{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/cebfc568124c4d44c82f8c9c1d845641.avif?t=1759514602\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span>In the near future, humanity is steadily expanding into the depths of space. You are an astronaut on a routine but important mission: follow a designated route to a remote station and deliver technical data.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/278b850ef283d111605279ca30578cb8.poster.avif?t=1759514602\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/278b850ef283d111605279ca30578cb8.webm?t=1759514602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/278b850ef283d111605279ca30578cb8.mp4?t=1759514602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Along the way, command contacts you with an additional request \u2014 retrieve documents from the research vessel <strong>&quot;Echo-7&quot;</strong>, which recently went silent. The silence is attributed to a recent geomagnetic storm disrupting communications.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/e76a17834e66eeda0f79897189f19498.poster.avif?t=1759514602\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/e76a17834e66eeda0f79897189f19498.webm?t=1759514602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/e76a17834e66eeda0f79897189f19498.mp4?t=1759514602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you approach Echo-7, you attempt to contact the crew \u2014 but there\u2019s no response. The ship appears functional from the outside. Inside \u2014 nothing. <br><br>No welcoming party, no signs of life. Just empty corridors, scattered personal belongings, and the unsettling feeling that you're not alone.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Realistic graphics</strong> \u2014 visual fidelity enhances the feeling of unease</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f <strong>Haunting atmosphere</strong> \u2014 silence, isolation, and growing tension follow your every step</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Immersive sound</strong> \u2014 rich audio design pulls you deep into the experience</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743180?t=1759514602","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743180?t=1759514602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/a77adb9b9404f236eec2a273e273373287400f1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759514602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/a77adb9b9404f236eec2a273e273373287400f1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759514602","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"\u26a0\ufe0f Health Warning\r\nCertain visual effects in Dire Echo, including flashing lights, rapid screen transitions, and high-contrast scenes, may trigger epileptic seizures or headaches in sensitive individuals.\r\n\r\nIf you experience dizziness, nausea, blurred vision, muscle twitching, or disorientation, stop playing immediately and consult a doctor."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/cebfc568124c4d44c82f8c9c1d845641.avif?t=1759514602\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span>In the near future, humanity is steadily expanding into the depths of space. You are an astronaut on a routine but important mission: follow a designated route to a remote station and deliver technical data.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/278b850ef283d111605279ca30578cb8.poster.avif?t=1759514602\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/278b850ef283d111605279ca30578cb8.webm?t=1759514602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/278b850ef283d111605279ca30578cb8.mp4?t=1759514602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Along the way, command contacts you with an additional request \u2014 retrieve documents from the research vessel <strong>&quot;Echo-7&quot;</strong>, which recently went silent. The silence is attributed to a recent geomagnetic storm disrupting communications.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/e76a17834e66eeda0f79897189f19498.poster.avif?t=1759514602\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/e76a17834e66eeda0f79897189f19498.webm?t=1759514602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/e76a17834e66eeda0f79897189f19498.mp4?t=1759514602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you approach Echo-7, you attempt to contact the crew \u2014 but there\u2019s no response. The ship appears functional from the outside. Inside \u2014 nothing. <br><br>No welcoming party, no signs of life. Just empty corridors, scattered personal belongings, and the unsettling feeling that you're not alone.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Realistic graphics</strong> \u2014 visual fidelity enhances the feeling of unease</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f <strong>Haunting atmosphere</strong> \u2014 silence, isolation, and growing tension follow your every step</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Immersive sound</strong> \u2014 rich audio design pulls you deep into the experience</p>","developers":["TrueGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/bdb0bd2eccc3f61aa00684898dc790886bc45f6a/header.jpg?t=1759514602","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3743180/1793355078/78bdc8bd1c3687465286e22e7179c67df1a4e489/1759514260/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759514600","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3743180/1793355078/78bdc8bd1c3687465286e22e7179c67df1a4e489/175951